<title>USA: Carthage, Texas, won by First Southwest.</title>
<headline>Carthage, Texas, won by First Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest said it won $1.800 million of Carthage, Texas, tax, waterworks and sewer system revenue limited tax certificates of obligation, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.618 percent.</p>
</text>
